[PrintTextModified Text:噫、噫噫噫噫噫！？<br>这太不妙了……！要死了要死了……！<br>真的要死了啦……！！|#CommonBad04_Coco007| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:错开着方向摆动着的刀刃缓缓降了下来。|#CommonBad04_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

